OL,3,AIran retaliates after US strikes kill
OL,4,Afour at wedding party, state media
OL,5,Areports
OL,6,
OL,7,FIran has launched attacks at US
OL,8,Fmilitary bases in Iraq and Jordan,
OL,9,Faccording to local state media and the
OL,10,FJordanian Armed Forces, after American
OL,11,Fforces resumed strikes against Iran on
OL,12,FTuesday.
OL,14,FThe Iranian Red Crescent said a US
OL,15,Fmissile attack had killed four people,
OL,16,Fincluding a child, when shrapnel hit a
OL,17,Fhome where a wedding celebration was
OL,18,Ftaking place in Sirik in southern Iran.
OL,20,FMore than 50 people were injured, it
OL,21,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
