OL,3,A'I've never been to Afghanistan': Six
OL,4,Amillion deportees forced to start over
OL,5,Aunder the Taliban
OL,6,
OL,7,F"But I've never been to Afghanistan
OL,8,Fbefore and many people here don't even
OL,9,Fhave enough bread to eat," Nazia sighs
OL,10,Fas she heads, two of her children in
OL,11,Ftow, toward registration counters
OL,12,Ffestooned with white and black Taliban
OL,13,Fflags.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
